	<tr class="windowbg">
		<td width="5%" valign="top"><b>Question:</b></td>
		<td>
			Is Everquest Going Downhill? Ending?
			<table>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding-top: 2ex;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
							<tr>
								<td>Yes.</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="49" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>9 (18.4%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>No.</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="81" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>15 (30.6%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>Slowly but surely.</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="114" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>21 (42.9%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>There won&#039;t be an EQ at the end of `04</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="5" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>1 (2%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>No - It&#039;s just Rodcet.</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="16" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>3 (6.1%)</td>
							</tr>
						</table>
					</td>
					<td valign="bottom" style="padding-left: 15px;">
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2"><b>Total Votes: 49</b></td>
				</tr>
			</table><br />
		</td>
	</tr>
