	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12754"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864" title="View the profile of Zorlo">Zorlo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 43<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Zorlo65@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1281.msg12754#msg12754"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1281.msg12754#msg12754">Re: Is it really all down hill from here?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> November 19, 2004, 06:31:13 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I agree with Yslane; Hegemony is really the only guild that completley died recently, and it was to a number of factors, not just EQ2, WoW, as it fell apart before either were live. And the fact that EiE/DA passed Ascent isn&#039;t exactly a Harbinger of the End. Things happen. It isn&#039;t like Ascent is over, while one can argue FoT is realtively equal with them now, it&#039;s not like Ascent is a poor guild. Besides that, most guilds are about the same as they&#039;ve always been, minus a few players who they woudl have inevitably lost over time anyways. A Guild opening apps dosen&#039;t mean anything; For someone who has always wanted to get some flags so they can get onto a higher plane of raiding (no-pun intended) should be happy. And seriously, of all the guilds listed as &quot;falling&quot; apart, i&#039;d say least correct is FoT, they&#039;ve done nothing but improve over time, and there is no indication otherwise.<br /><br />Seriously all: You&#039;ve missed the best new game that has come out in the last month anyways. San Andreas has taken my life stabbed it, and backed over it in a car it stole.<br /><br />Zorlo<br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
