	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12778"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 60<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1281.msg12778#msg12778"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1281.msg12778#msg12778">Re: Is it really all down hill from here?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> November 22, 2004, 06:05:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Repent! The end is near!<br /><br />Seriously, there may be server consolidations, etc., but EQ will be around for a good while I believe.&nbsp; Sheesh, I expect to hear an announcement for the next expansion soon, so get ready to add another 50 hit points to all your slots! Yay!<br /><br />There is a sufficient number of people who are of the &quot;I&#039;ve invested too much time in this character to play another game&quot; school of thought that EQ will continue for 3-5 years easy in my opinion.&nbsp; Personally, I&#039;ve never understood that thinking - if levelling in the game is actually fun, if character progression is fun, why wouldn&#039;t you want to try another game and experience a different world?&nbsp; Granted, levelling in EQ for many is not fun, grinding 500+ AA&#039;s is not fun, so these people are likely allowing EQ to blind them by assuming all the new MMORPGs are as boring and tedious as levelling in EQ.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
