							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1281.msg12791#msg12791"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1281.msg12791#msg12791">Re: Is it really all down hill from here?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> November 23, 2004, 02:42:39 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Here is&nbsp; my take on this moving stuff.... First of all why would they release a new expansion if they were going to get rid of the game at the end of the year total waste of money....Second&nbsp; there are always going to be people that just like to jump around to different games and in that case GL to them in what ever they choose to do....Third there are thousands of people that play this game and why would after lets say 4 years of playing just toss the game aside and go somewhere else...Don&#039;t get me wrong i know there are lots of them BUT this is still a good game for the casual player..... Speaking for myself I like to come on do 3 hours or so of play perhaps more depending on what I have going on the next day....I don&#039;t particularly want to start over on another game that for one just came out and is going to be buggy&nbsp; (please we all know how great they are at EQ 1 after patches ) and two I am going to have to have a fast computer to even run the graphics.&nbsp; I for one don&#039;t have the time nor the energy to be starting over from scratch in game and on my computer.&nbsp; &nbsp;I think sometimes we tend to over exadurate (sp) somethings and all in all it&#039;s going to turn out just as it always does EQ1 isn&#039;t going any where.....<br /><br />Just my 2cp worth<br /><br />Eshebala
						</td>
